{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030112902907-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030122425\"/><p>事主受傷清醒送院。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>西貢有人意外被困。今晨(30日)10時54分，一名年約60歲男子報案，指自己在蠔涌水口工作期間，腳部意外被困於泥頭車的車底。救援人員接報到場，將受傷清醒的事主救出交由救護車送往將軍澳醫院治理，案件列作「有人意外受傷」處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:41:46.110505+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T03:29:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:00:22.470289+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:38:46.455599+00:00","content_hash":"4310e0206976549ba4d91fab9e22250e8c2dafeaca84e5cd92f7043ae2f32dee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}